◆ CONVERSATION               │ ◆ COMPOSER
 Alt+↑ / ↓   Select msgs     │  ⌘← / →      Line ends
 ↵ / c       Copy item       │  ⌘⌫          Delete start
 e           Branch          │  ⌥/^ + ←→    Move word
 ^O          Copy reply      │  S/A + ↵     Newline
                             │  Alt+M       Model
◆ DASHBOARD                  │  Alt+E       Effort
 ^1 … ^4     Open tab        │
 Alt+← / →   Prev/next       │ ◆ APP
 Pg↑ / Pg↓   Scroll help     │  ^P          Commands
 ⇧Alt+←/→    Resize          │  ^D          Show/hide
                             │  ^C          Stop/cancel
◆ SESSIONS                   │  Esc ×2      Exit app
 ↑↓ / jk     Select          │  ^N          New chat
 ↵ / r       Resume          │
 f           Fork            │ ◆ AGENTS
 a           Archive         │  ↵           Focus/log
 u           Unarchive       │  ↑↓ / jk     Select
 v           Switch view     │  g / G       First/last
 n           Rename          │  r           Reload log
 /           Search          │
 d           Delete          │
